From: Cirrus Fedora packaging
Subject: [PATCH] Fedora: isolate the private EAC3 decoder from system FFmpeg

Apply only to the Cirrus Fedora build worktree. FFmpeg sources are unmodified.

--- a/src/infrastructure/media/audio_decoder.h
+++ b/src/infrastructure/media/audio_decoder.h
@@ -15,6 +15,7 @@
